":"c-nanqishu-032-zhangshu:p001","text":"兄子瓌、弟恕，誅吳郡太守劉遐。太祖欲以恕爲晉陵郡，岱曰：「恕未閑從政，美錦不宜濫裁。」太祖曰：「恕爲人，我所悉。且又與瓌同勳，自應有賞。」岱曰：「若以家貧賜祿，此所不論；語功推事，臣門之恥。」","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":46,"last_line":46,"raw_start":2151,"raw_end":2247,"raw_character_offsets":[2151,2152,2153,2154,2155,2156,2157,2158,2159,2160,2161,2162,2163,2164,2165,2166,2167,2168,2169,2170,2171,2172,2173,2174,2175,2176,2177,2178,2179,2180,2181,2182,2183,2184,2185,2186,2187,2188,2189,2190,2191,2192,2193,2194,2195,2196,2197,2198,2199,2200,2201,2202,2203,2204,2205,2206,2207,2208,2209,2210,2211,2212,2213,2214,2215,2216,2217,2218,2219,2220,2221,2222,2223,2224,2225,2226,2227,2228,2229,2230,2231,2232,2233,2234,2235,2236,2237,2238,2239,2240,2241,2242,2243,2244,2245,2246],"revision_id":1513918},"mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-032-zhangshu:p001:m0002","start":2,"end":3,"surface":"瓌","kind":"person","person_id":"d50_8f5_wul_AAAAEA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-032-zhangshu:p001:m0005","start":5,"end":6,"surface":"恕","kind":"person","person_id":"d50_8f5_wul_AAAAG","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-032-zhangshu:p001:m0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"劉遐","kind":"person","person_id":"3qs_nqa_ioa_AABBA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-032-zhangshu:p001:m0019","start":19,"end":20,"surface":"恕","kind":"person","person_id":"d50_8f5_wul_AAAAG","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-032-zhangshu:p001:m0025","start":25,"end":26,"surface":"岱","kind":"person","person_id":"d50_8f5_wul_AAAAD","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-032-zhangshu:p001:m0029","start":29,"end":30,"surface":"恕","kind":"person","person_id":"d50_8f5_wul_AAAAG","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-032-zhangshu:p001:m0048","start":48,"end":49,"surface":"恕","kind":"person","person_id":"d50_8f5_wul_AAAAG","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-032-zhangshu:p001:m0059","start":59,"en